#: aboutwidget.cpp:42 main.cpp:103
msgid "KDE Control Center"
msgstr "Kde Kontrole Sentrum"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:44
msgid "Configure your desktop environment."
msgstr "Konfigureer jou werkskerm omgewing."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:46
msgid ""
"Welcome to the \"KDE Control Center\", a central place to configure your "
"desktop environment. Select an item from the index on the left to load a "
"configuration module."
msgstr ""
"Welkom na die \"Kde Kontrole Sentrum\", 'n sentraal plek na konfigureer jou "
"werkskerm omgewing. Kies 'n item van die indeks op die links na las 'n "
"opstelling module."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:52 main.cpp:107
msgid "KDE Info Center"
msgstr "Kde Inligting Sentrum"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:54
msgid "Get system and desktop environment information"
msgstr "Kry stelsel en werkskerm omgewing inligting"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:56
msgid ""
"Welcome to the \"KDE Info Center\", a central place to find information about "
"your computer system."
msgstr ""
"Welkom na die \"Kde Inligting Sentrum\", 'n sentraal plek na soek informasie "
"aangaande jou rekenaar stelsel."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:60
msgid ""
"Click on the \"Help\" tab on the left to view help for the active control "
"module. Use the \"Search\" tab if you are unsure where to look for a particular "
"configuration option."
msgstr ""
"Kliek op die \"Hulp\" oortjie links om te kyk na Hulp vir die aktiewe kontrole "
"module. Gebruik die \"Soektog\" oortjie as jy onseker is waar om te kyk vir 'n "
"spesifieke opstelling opsie."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:66
msgid "KDE version:"
msgstr "Kde weergawe:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:67
msgid "User:"
msgstr "Gebruiker:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:68
msgid "Hostname:"
msgstr "Gasgewer naam:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:69
msgid "System:"
msgstr "Stelsel:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:70
msgid "Release:"
msgstr "Vrylaat:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:71
msgid "Machine:"
msgstr "Masjien:"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:133
msgid "<big><b>Loading...</b></big>"
msgstr "<big><b>Laaiïng van...</b></big>"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:201 toplevel.cpp:374
msgid ""
"There are unsaved changes in the active module.\n"
"Do you want to apply the changes before running the new module or discard the "
"changes?"
msgstr ""
"Daar word ongestoorde verander in die aktief module.\n"
"Doen jy wil hê na wend aan die verander voor wat loop die nuwe module of gooi "
"weg die verander?"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:204 toplevel.cpp:377
msgid ""
"There are unsaved changes in the active module.\n"
"Do you want to apply the changes before exiting the Control Center or discard "
"the changes?"
msgstr ""
"Daar word ongestoorde verander in die aktief module.\n"
"Doen jy wil hê na wend aan die verander voor besig om toe te maak die Kontrole "
"Sentrum of gooi weg die verander?"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:207 toplevel.cpp:380
msgid "Unsaved Changes"
msgstr "Ongestoorde Verander"

#: helpwidget.cpp:44
msgid ""
"<p>Use the \"Whats This\" (Shift+F1) to get help on specific options.</p>"
"<p>To read the full manual click <a href=\"%1\">here</a>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Gebruik die \"Wat is Dit\" (Shift+F1) om hulp tebekom op spesifieke "
"opsies.</p>"
"<p>Om die volledige handboek te lees kliek op <a href=\"%1\">hier</a>.</p>"

#: helpwidget.cpp:51
msgid ""
"<h1>KDE Info Center</h1>There is no quick help available for the active info "
"module."
"<br>"
"<br>Click <a href = \"kinfocenter/index.html\">here</a> "
"to read the general Info Center manual."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Kde Inligting Sentrum</h1>Daar is nee vinnige hulp beskikbaar vir die "
"aktief Inligting module."
"<br>"
"<br>Kliek <a href = \"kinfocenter/index.html\">hier</a> "
"na lees die algemeen Inligting Sentrum hand."

#: helpwidget.cpp:56
msgid ""
"<h1>KDE Control Center</h1>There is no quick help available for the active "
"control module."
"<br>"
"<br>Click <a href = \"kcontrol/index.html\">here</a> "
"to read the general Control Center manual."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Kde Kontrole Sentrum</h1>Daar is nee vinnige hulp beskikbaar vir die aktief "
"Kontrole module."
"<br>"
"<br>Kliek <a href = \"kcontrol/index.html\">hier</a> "
"na lees die algemeen Kontrole Sentrum hand."

#: kcrootonly.cpp:30
msgid ""
"<big>You need super user privileges to run this control module.</big>"
"<br>Click on the \"Administrator Mode\" button below."
msgstr ""
"<big>Jy benodig super gebruiker voorregte na hardloop hierdie kontrole "
"module.</big>"
"<br>Kliek op die \"Administrateur Modus\" knoppie onder."

#: main.cpp:104
msgid "The KDE Control Center"
msgstr "Die Kde Kontrole Sentrum"

#: main.cpp:105 main.cpp:109
msgid "(c) 1998-2004, The KDE Control Center Developers"
msgstr "(c) 1998-2004, Die Kde Kontrole Sentrum Ontwikkelaars"

#: main.cpp:108
msgid "The KDE Info Center"
msgstr "Die Kde Inligting Sentrum"

#: main.cpp:127 main.cpp:129
msgid "Current Maintainer"
msgstr "Huidige Onderhouer"

#: modules.cpp:154
msgid "<big>Loading...</big>"
msgstr "<big>Laaiïng van...</big>"

#: moduletreeview.cpp:65
msgid "The %1 configuration group. Click to open it."
msgstr "Die %1 opstelling groep. Kliek na open dit."

#: moduletreeview.cpp:67
msgid ""
"This treeview displays all available control modules. Click on one of the "
"modules to receive more detailed information."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie boom aansig vertoon alle beskikbaar kontrole modules. Kliek op een van "
"die modules na ontvang meer gedetaileerde informasie."

#: proxywidget.cpp:54
msgid "The currently loaded configuration module."
msgstr "Die huidiglik gelaai opstelling module."

#: proxywidget.cpp:88
msgid ""
"<b>Changes in this module require root access.</b>"
"<br>Click the \"Administrator Mode\" button to allow modifications in this "
"module."
msgstr ""
"<b>Verander in hierdie module vereis root toegang verkry.</b>"
"<br>Kliek die \"Administrateur Modus\" knoppie na toelaat veranderinge in "
"hierdie module."

#: proxywidget.cpp:92
msgid ""
"This module requires special permissions, probably for system-wide "
"modifications; therefore, it is required that you provide the root password to "
"be able to change the module's properties.  If you do not provide the password, "
"the module will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie module benodig spesiaal regte, waarskynlik vir system-wye veranderinge; "
"daarom, is is nodig dat jy verskaf die root wagwoord om in staat te wee om die "
"modules eienskappe te verander. Indien jy nie die wagwoord verskaf nie, sal die "
"module gestremd wees."

#: proxywidget.cpp:211
msgid "&Reset"
msgstr "Herstel"

